s-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radical_Shack\" title=\"Radical Shack\">Radical Shack</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Power\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Power</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Distance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Distance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">13</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Time\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Time</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.75</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$16,790</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.10.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">June 23rd, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote><p><big><i>\"A bamboo axe with strange natural powers... Absorbs the power of other trees, resulting in more force applied to chops. bamboo inflicts a temporary stasis of lighter weight on chopped materials\"</i></big></p></blockquote>\n<p>The <b>Living Axe</b>, sometimes referred to as the <b>Bamboo Axe</b>, is an axe that can be purchased from the <a href=\"/wiki/Radical_Shack\" title=\"Radical Shack\">Radical Shack</a> for $16,790.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<p>The Living Axe is a medium sized hatchet with a handle made of bamboo, and what appears to be green stone as its blade. In its default state, the Living Axe is simply faster than the <a href=\"/wiki/Tall_Refined_Axe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tall Refined Axe\">Tall Refined Axe</a>. Additionally, the Living Axe has four notable abilities: \n</p>\n<ol><li>The axe gains more swing power the more <i>rooted</i> trees are nearby; this is most easily noticed in <a href=\"/wiki/Uncertainty_Cave\" title=\"Uncertainty Cave\">Uncertainty Cave</a> due to the high density of <a href=\"/wiki/Mushrooms\" title=\"Mushrooms\">Mushrooms</a>.</li>\n<li>it makes any tree it lands the finishing chop on nearly weightless, which allows for carrying around heavy trees like <a href=\"/wiki/Redwood\" title=\"Redwood\">Redwood</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Petrified_Oak\" title=\"Petrified Oak\">Petrified Oak</a> as if they weigh nothing. Although the description claims that this weightlessness is only temporary, it lasts indefinitely.</li>\n<li>As of the 1.61.0 update, it allows fallen trees to retain their leaves, allowing for more decoration options.</li>\n<li>And finally, added in the 1.62.0 update, the axe has the ability to cut down trees bearing <a href=\"/wiki/Fruits\" title=\"Fruits\">fruit</a> without any of them rotting, unlike all other axes, which makes every fruit have a chance of rotting, making them disappear after a few seconds of doing so.</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This axe was part of the first ever Secret Friday Update.</li>\n<li>It is the first axe added to have special abilities.</li>\n<li>Despite the fact that handle is made to resemble a bamboo, the <a href=\"/wiki/Bamboo\" title=\"Bamboo\">Bamboo</a> has a completely different design, lacking the stem rings.</li>\n<li>This axe does not remove leaves off chopped trees unlike other axes.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903082349\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 81/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 60/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019470/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   34.964      1 Template:Axe\n100.00%   34.964      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:888-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903082349 and revision id 18483. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Tools","Axes"],"links":[{"title":"Radical Shack","exists":true},{"title":"Bamboo","exists":true},{"title":"Fruits","exists":true},{"title":"Mushrooms","exists":true},{"title":"Petrified Oak","exists":true},{"title":"Redwood","exists":true},{"title":"Tall Refined Axe","exists":true},{"title":"Uncertainty Cave","exists":true}],"images":["The_Living_Axe.png","The_Living_Axe(boxed).png"]}
